.TH dokument\-previewer 1 2025\-04\-22 GNOME
.SH NAME
dokument\-previewer \- show a printing preview of PDF and DjVu documents
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdokument\-previewer\fR [options] \fBinput\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
dokument\-previewer is a GNOME program to
show a printing preview from Portable Document Format (PDF) and DjVu files.

This program is not meant to be called by end-users.
.SH OPTIONS
dokument\-previewer obeys all normal GNOME and GTK+ command line options.
The application options are
.TP
\fB\-u, \-\-unlink\-tempfile\fR
Delete the temporary file
.TP
\fB\-p, \-\-print-settings=FILE\fR
Print settings file
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBdokument\fR(1)
